[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=21 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山办公室外面的工坊还没关。有人把一盏船灯拆成零件，打算用不太匹配的新壳装回去。你停下看了一会儿，认出灯罩上有第五队的编号。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="工匠"

speaker_name=""

text="别紧张，能修。今天你们谁拿它当门挡了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="门自己关上来的。这个说法能便宜一点吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="工匠"

speaker_name=""

text="能，先欠着。修好以后让门来签账。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿笑着去搬替换件，你留在台前，看见抽屉里按大小排好的螺丝。工匠说这是以前一位师傅留下的习惯，后来换过几个人，都懒得重新分。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果师傅回来，会不会觉得你们把东西弄乱了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="工匠"

speaker_name=""

text="会。他每回回来都这么说，有次发现抽屉是自己放反的，还非说我们把桌搬了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你本来以为那是一位已经不在的人，忽然被这个仍然活着的抱怨逗笑了。工匠问你是不是总把旧东西背后的故事想得太悲壮，你只好点头。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="工匠"

speaker_name=""

text="有些人没回来，有些人只是去隔壁。先问，别急着给每把扳手默哀。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="门帘后走出一位很瘦的老人，先把工匠骂了一句，然后把你们的灯拿过去。他说这款灯的接头方向别装反，光亮了不算修完，拿到雨里也得试。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那我拿出去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="老师傅"

speaker_name=""

text="先扣好罩，再拿。别为了显得肯帮忙，跳过一半活。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们在屋檐下试灯，雨滴打在新罩上，灯没有暗。老人让你把它放到栏杆远端，再走回来，看航路上要用的人是不是真的看得清。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="现在能看见。可是我在这边，船上也一样吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="老师傅"

speaker_name=""

text="角度不同。你们回船上再试一次，别用我站着看得到替你们开船的人作证。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把这个要求写到交接条上。德雷顿回来时，先问价钱，再把工单编号记好，没有因为工匠一句先欠着，就假装事情已经结了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="欠着可以，得知道欠谁。要不回头你还账还错人，人家还以为莫名多收一笔。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你摸了摸钥匙，想起自己答应洗的毯子。那些微小又可以履行的债，在这么一个晚上，竟比没有名字的巨大过去更容易让你知道明天该做什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton"])

actor_tones={}

